  "prefLabel": "Plc 1802.27 Municipal assessing officials",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1802.27 “Municipal assessing officials” means those charged by law with the duty of assessing taxes and who are the:\n\n(a) Governing body of a municipality;\n\n(b) Board of assessors or selectmen of a municipality; or\n\n(c) County commissioners of an unincorporated place.\n\nSource. #14330, eff 9-22-25, EXPIRES: 9-22-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1800.html"
